{"seq":2,"slug":"passive-investing","title":"被动投资","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-finance-investing","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"被动投资\">被动投资</h1><blockquote>\n<p>从博格尔哲学到 ETF 运作机制，从全球指数体系到定投实践，系统学习如何以最低成本获取市场平均收益。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"为什么学习被动投资\">为什么学习被动投资</h2><p>2026 年，中国 ETF 市场规模突破 5 万亿元，产品数量超过 1500 只，中国已成为亚洲最大的 ETF 市场。被动投资不再是&quot;躺平策略&quot;——它是一套建立在有效市场假说、成本理论和行为金融学之上的完整投资方法论。学术研究持续表明：在扣除费用后，绝大多数主动管理基金无法长期跑赢对应的基准指数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-覆盖范围\">本 Hub 覆盖范围</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((被动投资))&#10;    指数基金理论&#10;      博格尔哲学&#10;      市值加权与替代加权&#10;      跟踪误差与基金评价&#10;    ETF 运作机制&#10;      申购赎回机制&#10;      做市商与流动性&#10;      税务效率&#10;    全球指数化&#10;      全球主要指数体系&#10;      中国指数投资格局&#10;      汇率风险与对冲&#10;    实施执行&#10;      定投与一次性投入&#10;      再平衡实践&#10;      FIRE 运动与被动收入\">mindmap\n  root((被动投资))\n    指数基金理论\n      博格尔哲学\n      市值加权与替代加权\n      跟踪误差与基金评价\n    ETF 运作机制\n      申购赎回机制\n      做市商与流动性\n      税务效率\n    全球指数化\n      全球主要指数体系\n      中国指数投资格局\n      汇率风险与对冲\n    实施执行\n      定投与一次性投入\n      再平衡实践\n      FIRE 运动与被动收入</pre><h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>适合谁</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指数基金理论</td>\n<td>为什么被动优于主动？成本如何吞噬复合？</td>\n<td>所有读者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ETF 运作机制</td>\n<td>ETF 如何运作？为什么比共同基金更优？</td>\n<td>想深入理解产品的人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球指数化</td>\n<td>如何构建全球化指数组合？如何管理汇率？</td>\n<td>有跨境需求的投资者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实施执行</td>\n<td>定投还是梭哈？何时再平衡？如何实现 FIRE？</td>\n<td>所有读者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本复利概念与时间价值</li>\n<li>股票和债券的基本分类</li>\n<li>基金（共同基金、ETF）的基本概念</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"index-fund-theory","title":"指数基金理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bogle-philosophy","title":"博格尔投资哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/bogle-philosophy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-cap-weighting","title":"市值加权与替代加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/market-cap-weighting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tracking-error","title":"跟踪误差与基金评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/index-fund-theory/tracking-error"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"etf-mechanics","title":"ETF 运作机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/etf-mechanics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"creation-redemption","title":"申购赎回机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/etf-mechanics/creation-redemption"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-making","title":"做市商与流动性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/etf-mechanics/market-making"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tax-efficiency","title":"税务效率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/etf-mechanics/tax-efficiency"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-indexing","title":"全球指数化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/global-indexing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"world-indices","title":"全球主要指数体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/global-indexing/world-indices"},{"seq":2,"slug":"china-index-landscape","title":"中国指数投资格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/global-indexing/china-index-landscape"},{"seq":3,"slug":"currency-hedging","title":"汇率风险与对冲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/passive-investing/global-indexing/currency-hedging"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"implementation","title":"实施执行","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/perso